==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*tauti}}, borrowed from {{der|fi|gmq-pro|tr=*dauđi}} (cf. {{cog|gem-pro|*dauþuz}}). Cognates include {{cog|et|taud||a pestilence or infectious disease}}, {{cog|is|dauði||death}} and {{cog|sv|död||death}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=fi|/ˈt̪ɑut̪i/}}
* {{hyphenation|tau|ti|lang=fi}}

